  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 302.13 Critical error",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 302.13 “Critical error” means any failure to complete a required field in a licensee’s electronic return that prevents the return from being accepted by the state’s road toll processing system.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 300) #10032, eff 11-22-11; renumbered by #10753 (formerly Saf-C 302.08); ss by #13186, eff 4-7-21 (formerly Saf-C 302.11) (See Revision Note #3 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 300)",
